OL,3,GNEWSAHow a Surrey teacher helped break
OL,4,Athe Enigma code
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the three mathematicians who
OL,7,Fhelped break the German military Enigma
OL,8,Fcipher before World War Two is being
OL,9,Fhonoured in Surrey.
OL,11,FHenryk Zygalski, Marian Rejewski and
OL,12,FJerzy RoE<ycki, all from Poland, worked
OL,13,Fout how to read messages sent on Enigma
OL,14,Fin the 1930s.
OL,16,FJust weeks before Hitler invaded
OL,17,FPoland, the trio shared all they knew
OL,18,Fwith British and French intelligence,
OL,19,Fpaving the way for Alan Turing's Bombe
OL,20,Fmachine at Bletchley Park.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
