OL,3,GNEWSAHow a Surrey teacher helped break
OL,4,Athe Enigma code
OL,5,
OL,6,FZygalski arrived in England in 1943 and
OL,7,Fchose to remain here after the war. He
OL,8,Ftaught maths at an early iteration of
OL,9,Fthe University of Surrey - where a
OL,10,Fplaque commemorating his efforts has
OL,11,Fbeen unveiled.
